{"repositoryId":726013572,"availability":"available","full":"horseee/DeepCache","name":"DeepCache","description":"[CVPR 2024] DeepCache: Accelerating Diffusion Models for Free","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":968,"forks":51,"created":"2023-12-01T10:54:04Z","updated":"2024-06-27T05:47:35Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://horseee.github.io/Diffusion_DeepCache/","topics":["diffusion-models","efficient-inference","model-compression","stable-diffusion","training-free"],"demo":"https://horseee.github.io/Diffusion_DeepCache/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:21.454Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:21.454Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:21.454Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T12:31:21.454Z","stars":968,"forks":51}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["(Results on Stable Diffusion v1.5. Left: 50 PLMS steps. Right: 2.3x acceleration upon 50 PLMS steps)","DeepCache: Accelerating Diffusion Models for Free Xinyin Ma, Gongfan Fang, Xinchao Wang Learning and Vision Lab, National University of Singapore 🥯[[Arxiv]]( Page]](","We introduce DeepCache, a novel training-free and almost lossless paradigm that accelerates diffusion models from the perspective of model architecture. Utilizing the property of the U-Net, we reuse the high-level features while updating the low-level features in a very cheap way. DeepCache accelerates Stable Diffusion v1.5 by 2.3x with only a 0.05 decline in CLIP Score, and LDM-4-G(ImageNet) by 4.1x with a 0.22 decrease in FID."],"features":["🚀 Training-free and almost lossless","🚀 Support Stable Diffusion, Stable Diffusion XL, Stable Video Diffusion, Stable Diffusion Pipeline / XL Pipeline for Inpainting, Stable Diffusion Img2Img Pipeline, DDPM","🚀 Compatible with sampling algorithms like DDIM and PLMS"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/horseee/DeepCache/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"2fa09ccfeb1177790d81d3c37